// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Billy Flint 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3326971651" "Billy Flint"
// LocationString :
"P746986355" "People's Park"
// ProfessionString :
"P860068866" "Gardner"
// DescriptionString :
"P2310399204" "Billy Flint is in the wrong place at the wrong time."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1787117514" "I mistrust your motives, {HeroName}, and I mistrust you. Leave me be."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P3951989823" "Wrong alliance"
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1451910163" "I Don't Know You"
// TaskDeclineOverride :
"P3925625463" "There's something else I meant to ask you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1261189394" "No Tasks Remaining"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1064212529" "Player Busy"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P998890811" "Come Back Later"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1845142919" "Friend!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2589679149" "Confidant!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P3835068112" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br>You picked the wrong time to take a stroll through the park. It sounds like the P.P.D. have the place surrounded.<br><br><color orange>My guess is they're looking for the Resistance, that group trying to remove Emperor Cole from power.</color><br><br>Heh, good luck with that. If Hamidon couldn't do it, I doubt anyone could."
// Answer Text :
"P3124371341" "What happened here?"
// Answer Text :
"P1524898008" "How do I get out of here?"
// Answer Text :
"P2926369652" "Why are you on your knees?"
// Page WhatHappened Text :
"P70883035" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Emperor Cole</color> doesn't take kindly to people upsetting the status quo. We've got a good thing going here in <color deepskyblue>Praetoria</color>. The P.P.D are going to do whatever it takes to make sure things stay that way.<br><br>So, sometimes, they've got to lay down the law when they hear about a group of these subversives meeting up. This park is a popular recruitment spot for them, not sure why."
// Page Knees Text :
"P1200676519" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br>I'm a gardener. I spend a lot of time on my knees. This isn't that different.<br><br>Seriously though, I've learned it's always best when you see the P.P.D. around to become as submissive as possible. It's the only real way to show you're not one of 'them', you know? This will be over soon and since I'm down here, I've already seen a couple weeds that need pulling."
// Page IDontKnowYou Text :
"P3063709046" "I don't know you."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page NoTaskRemaining Text :
"P3139267637" "I don't have anything else for you."
// Page PlayerBusy Text :
"P3665770048" "You've got other things to do."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


