// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Tutorial_Calvin_Scott 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 32 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Calvin Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3562048904" "Reese is a high ranking member of the Praetorian Police Department. He delegates all the dangerous stuff to others and takes the credit for it. That's why he's a high ranking member of the Praetorian Police Department."
// WrongAllianceString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3371146149" "Who the heck are you?"
// TaskDeclineOverride :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P3336443960" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br>I got the memo about you, {HeroName}. Seems as if you're being assigned to my division for a while.<br><br>What, you think you're special just because you can put on a costume? Do you know who I am? I'm the guy who's better than you, that's who. Get used to it.<br><br>Come to think of it, I have a task that can't be handled by someone as important and recognizable as I. So I guess you actually showed up at the perfect time. I take back what I said earlier. I'm glad you're here..."
// Answer Text :
"P1957652412" "What do you need me to do?"
// Answer Text :
"P2813565768" "I'm turning in my resignation."
// Answer Text :
// Page Resignation Text :
"P811190146" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br>Throwing in the towel your first day on the job? That's funny. You don't tell me when you resign, <b>I tell you</b> when you resign.<br><br>Look here, you {Hero.gender=Male slimy weasel|worthless tramp}, you work with me or you disappear. We don't let powered individuals roam free on the streets unless they are serving Emperor Cole."
// Answer Text :
"P1747540319" "Whatever. What's my mission?"
// Answer Text :
"P1392117303" "I work for me, got it?"
// Page SelfEmployed Text :
"P3742524918" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br>That's nothing new, that's why I picked you for this mission. You've got spirit. I've got a lot on my shoulders here, if you can prove yourself on this mission, I will make it worth your while."
// Answer Text :
"P3287272117" "Fine."
// Page WhatsGoingOn Text :
"P3053863017" "<color deepskyblue>Welcome to Praetoria</color><br><br>The Destroyers are assaulting the precinct, what's it look like? Feel free to take down a few before you start your mission, but I pretty much have it under control."
// Answer Text :
// Page IDontKnowYou Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page NoTaskRemaining Text :
// Page PlayerBusy Text :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


