// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : P_Tutorial_Officer_Flint 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Officer Flint 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P194545998" "Officer Flint"
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1975943188" "Officer Flint is a loyal and law-abiding member of the Praetorian Police Department with an outstanding record. He's been tasked with getting the new Powers Division recruits up to speed. This means you."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2633438836" "Good luck, {Heroname}."
// IntroString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
// TaskDeclineOverride :
"P1881075934" "(Optional) There's something else I meant to ask you."
// FailsafeLevelString :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P561006849" "Welcome to the Powers Division, recruit.<br><br>Today you will have your first live fire mission. You've been assigned to Reese, one of the Top Dogs in the Powers Division.<br><br>Before you meet with him, I'd like to send you through basic training.<br><br><color orange>Click on any of the lines of text below to continue this conversation.<br><br>If you choose BEGINNER, you will be taught the game play basics before meeting Reese. Only choose VETERAN if you are already familiar with combat, navigation, conning, and power usage in City of Heroes.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3636411996" "(BEGINNER) Alright, sounds good.  I'm ready for basic training."
// Answer Text :
"P484254356" "(VETERAN) I'm a veteran, I don't need to go through bootcamp again."
// Answer Text :
"P2337707141" "(Optional) Wait, something isn't right here."
// Page QuestionsFirst Text :
"P2224342356" "What?  What is it that is bothering you, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P54973573" "(Optional) Where am I?"
// Answer Text :
"P2364076540" "(Optional) I didn't join the Powers Division!"
// Answer Text :
"P2236106196" "(Optional) Powers Division? I don't have super powers."
// Answer Text :
"P125316056" "(Optional) Powers Division? Technology doesn't exactly count as super powers."
// Page AreYouReady Text :
"P2409574782" "Before you meet with Reese, I'd like to send you through basic training. This will teach you the skills you need to tackle whatever mission Reese might throw you into.<br><br>Unless you're good to go, of course. Can never tell how much you Powers Division people already know.<br><br><color orange>If you choose BEGINNER, you will be taught the game play basics before meeting Reese. Only choose VETERAN if you are already familiar with combat, navigation, conning, and power usage in City of Heroes."
// Answer Text :
"P3367818506" "(Optional) Wait! Start over again..."
// Page DidntJoin Text :
"P3972480575" "Hahaha. And yet here you are.<br><br>If you have super powers, want to carry a gun or other weapon, or are an expert in unarmed combat, you join the Powers Division.<br><br>It's the law. We have a 100% recruitment rate."
// Answer Text :
"P3376676143" "Fine. What is my mission?"
// Answer Text :
"P2525297990" "(Optional) I can't own a weapon or be a martial arts expert without being in Powers Division?"
// Answer Text :
"P3470013300" "(Optional) Wait, I've never heard of these laws!"
// Answer Text :
"P2591249817" "(Optional) Yeah, we'll see about that."
// Page NaturalOrigin Text :
"P435768278" "Hahaha. Your natural abilities far surpass those of normal beings.<br><br>If you have super powers, want to carry a gun or other weapon, or are an expert in unarmed combat, you join the Powers Division.<br><br>It's the law. We have a 100% recruitment rate."
// Page TechOrigin Text :
"P1896956689" "Hahaha. And yet here you are.<br><br>Not having inherent superpowers means nothing if you have super-gadgetry. How many gadgets do you have hiding in that costume, anyway? Even if you got rid of all your gadgetry or even surrendered it to the Empire, you have now demonstrated that you can procure or create super-powered gadgets, thus are required to join the Powers Division.<br><br>It's the law. We have a 100% recruitment rate."
// Page IllegalWeaponry Text :
"P1460432921" "Why would you want a weapon?  <color orange>Emperor Cole</color> has abolished war and outlawed all forms of unauthorized weaponry.  The only reason to have unauthorized weaponry would be to commit crime."
// Answer Text :
"P2692821330" "(Optional) What about self-defense?"
// Page SelfDefense Text :
"P2206260077" "The PPD and Powers Division defend the people from all outside threats.  You don't need self-defense.<br><br>Unauthorized thugs with weapons are a threat to public safety.<br><br>But as a member of Powers Division you have full authorization to use lethal force against anyone using unauthorized weaponry."
// Answer Text :
"P3737678617" "I'm ready to enforce public safety."
// Answer Text :
"P3332222212" "(Optional) What about freedom?  You people are insane!"
// Page OutofTowner Text :
"P1481746556" "You must not be from around here.  This is Praetoria, <color orange>Emperor Cole's</color> utopia.<br><br>The Powers Division is a special division of the Praetoria Police Department: the PPD.  Most of the PPD do the day-to-day maintenance of the peace, but the Powers Division is called in for missions that require your special skills.  Just because you have super powers doesn't mean you're better than anybody.  It means you have a civic duty to serve.<br><br>Me?  I chose this job because I believe in <color orange>Emperor Cole's</color> vision."
// Answer Text :
"P609713514" "What is this mission you mentioned?"
// Answer Text :
"P2001078932" "(Optional) What? I didn't join the Powers Division!"
// Answer Text :
"P3810451673" "(Optional) Yeah, right."
// Page Flak Text :
"P2957182351" "Look, kid.  You obviously don't like me, and I don't like your attitude.  But if you want to get out of the Powers Division already, you'll have to go take it up with Reese."
// Answer Text :
"P2977903288" "Alright, I'll do that."
// Answer Text :
"P2787317035" "Whatever."
// Page IDontKnowYou Text :
"P3408968698" "Why are you still talking to me? You've got other things to do."
// Answer Text :
// Page NoTaskRemaining Text :
"P1837116639" "You are already done with your orientation. Talk to Reese, you report directly to him now."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


