// Page HelloPage Text :
"P792549194" "I got the memo about you, {HeroName}. You're being assigned to my division for a while.<br><br>Do you know who I am? I am a Top Dog in Praetor White's Powers Division.  That means I'm famous, well known, and respected.<br><br>However, I have a task that can only be handled by an unrecognizable greenie. That's you."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P864239530" "(Optional) What's going on here?"
// Answer Text :
"P189618358" "(Optional) I'm turning in my resignation."
// Page Resignation Text :
"P192442731" "Throwing in the towel your first day on the job? That's funny. You don't tell me when you resign, <color red>I tell you</color> when you resign.<br><br>Look here, you {Hero.gender=Male slimy weasel|worthless tramp}, you work with me or you disappear. We don't let powered individuals roam free on the streets unless they are serving Emperor Cole."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P3551420695" "(Optional) I work for me, got it?"
// Page SelfEmployed Text :
"P2872358578" "That's nothing new, that's why I picked you for this mission.<br><br>You've got spirit. I've got a lot on my shoulders here and I need someone who I don't need to babysit. If you can prove yourself on this mission, I will make it worth your while."
// Answer Text :
// Page WhatsGoingOn Text :
"P1613463926" "The Destroyers are assaulting the precinct, what's it look like? Feel free to take down a few on the way to your mission, but as you can see, I pretty much have it under control."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P2485489778" "(Optional) Who are the Destroyers?"
// Page AboutDestroyers Text :
"P3367141861" "The Destroyers believe in only one thing: the strong make the rules. They've been getting more violent every day, but they are disorganized anarchists. So once I wipe them out, they're gone. I'll probably be done with them by the time you get back out.<br><br>The Resistance are another thing entirely; they are subverting members of our orderly society with their lies and propaganda. I need an insider to weed them out. That's where you come in."
// Answer Text :
"P2128647557" "Me? What can I do?"
// Answer Text :
"P2705387039" "(Optional) I don't want to be part of this, I have my own things to do."
